Sony's changes to xnu-1456.1.26's bsd/dev/dtrace/blist.c (Sony's dtrace/bsd/blist.c),
read from deci4p_dtracep: memory from DTrace's heap, the kernel's panic in place of
panic() (Sony's debug records give the panics' lines, which this file keeps), and an
unsigned index in blst_copy's leaf loop. BLIST_BMAP_RADIX is an int in Sony's
dtrace/bsd/blist.h (sys/internal/include/dtrace/bsd/blist.h).

--- a/blist.c
+++ b/blist.c
